{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2021-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1637625600, "end_date": 1638316799, "month_true_total": 54, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:51:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "104905509", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017439086", "personaname": "DavidKnowsGod", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017439086/", "num_games_owned": 6723, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 5045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3752, "last_played": 1684043387, "avatar": "ce8941f082720b41b92159499598adc05a2ec3b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF! EDF! EDF! EDFFFFFFFF!", "timestamp_created": 1638312980, "timestamp_updated": 1638312980, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49931412935256958", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104890285", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960271945", "personaname": "CRACKY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SupremeJesus/", "num_games_owned": 1359, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 256, "last_played": 1679552584, "avatar": "abe8012c30fdc492ac4255e8278ebccea1866691"}, "language": "english", "review": "[table]\n    [tr]\n        [th]Category[/th]\n        [th]Score[/th]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Graphics[/td]\n        [td]7.0[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Story[/td]\n        [td]6.0[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Innovation[/td]\n        [td]8.0[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Multiplayer[/td]\n        [td]8.5[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Fun Factor[/td]\n        [td]9.0[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Replayability[/td]\n        [td]7.0[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [td]Overall[/td]\n        [td]7.5[/td]\n    [/tr]\n[/table]\n\nSynopsis: You are a normal citizen who gets dragged in to a massive alien invasion. Eventually you join the EDF and help fight said aliens and try to reclaim the Earth. This is a game series that has never taken itself too seriously and it's wonderful. The game features several different classes to choose from and a ton of \"weapons\" you can find/upgrade. The story and graphics are nothing to write home about, but that's not the focus. The game is basically a 3-D bullet-hell mode come to life. You will be facing waves and waves of gigantic creatures (usually based off insects) all the while trying desperately to manage your health and keeping your squad alive. The game really opens up on the harder difficulties and multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1638304424, "timestamp_updated": 1638304424, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104742897", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081543946", "personaname": "Bohn Gravolta™", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198081543946/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 9058, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9058, "last_played": 1615330043, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF is always a fun game that i can turn my brain off and kill swarms of ants spiders aliens and all sorts", "timestamp_created": 1638213862, "timestamp_updated": 1638213862, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "receiv